// Grounded Brain: sign-in and authenticated requests (Better Auth)
// Eraser "Sequence Diagram" diagram-as-code
title Authentication (Better Auth cookie sessions)
autoNumber on

Browser [icon: monitor, color: gray] > Express [icon: nodejs, color: green]: POST /api/auth/sign-in/email {email, password}
Express > Better Auth [icon: lock, color: purple]: toNodeHandler(auth)
Better Auth > Postgres [icon: postgres, color: blue]: verify account, create session row
Better Auth --> Browser: 200 + Set-Cookie: session token

Browser > Express: GET /api/workspaces (Cookie)
Express > Better Auth: requireAuth → auth.api.getSession(headers)
Better Auth > Postgres: look up session by token
Better Auth --> Express: { user, session }
Express --> Browser: 200 { success: true, data: [...] }
